{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/extras/0d36570788e65d97673e573f2b0d950e.avif?t=1774580959\" width=1072 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MechShell</strong> is a fast-paced action game that <strong>shifts seamlessly between side-scrolling combat and first-person action</strong>, forcing you to adapt as the battlefield transforms.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the <strong>Gnome Empire</strong>, led by a reclusive Emperor with an oversized ego.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop their quest for total domination using <strong>technology stolen from Shellion</strong>, the ancient snail nation, targeting the thriving capital, <strong>Shellion Prime</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/extras/10094753a09af8cfdb6e2c6ce7ba3dff.avif?t=1774580959\" width=1072 height=254 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Shellion Guard and fight to save Shellion Prime from the Gnome Empire!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, roll, and blast through <strong>lush, war-torn biomes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle waves of enemies, deadly traps, and elite bosses in both <strong>side-scroller and first-person combat</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/extras/4357fe4cc189a82c300324265311ad88.avif?t=1774580959\" width=1072 height=254 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch <strong>instantly between side-scrolling and first-person views</strong> for dynamic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy as the battlefield transforms around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves, traps, and bosses in both perspectives, keeping every encounter fresh and challenging.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/extras/6b58ae4271219e0876db4a8af52f7382.avif?t=1774580959\" width=1072 height=254 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>over 100 combinations of customizable weapons, abilities, and shell upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match loadouts to fit your playstyle: brute force, tactics, or clever gadgets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/extras/40fc73dd26eb6135b38947216a185590.avif?t=1774580959\" width=1072 height=254 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>local or online co-op</strong> with up to four players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive allies and coordinate devastating combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perspective shifts make co-op runs chaotic and unpredictable.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/extras/5ac38357d7c71c84a348f004af733d08.avif?t=1774580959\" width=1072 height=254 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for replayability:</strong> every run is different, encouraging experimentation and mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn currency, unlock permanent upgrades, and discover hidden areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints and revive systems <strong>keep momentum high</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different, encouraging experimentation and mastery.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931770?t=1774580959","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931770?t=1774580959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/da38e14495a7dcf1d4252acbcb60303d97de5e4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774580959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/da38e14495a7dcf1d4252acbcb60303d97de5e4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774580959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/extras/0d36570788e65d97673e573f2b0d950e.avif?t=1774580959\" width=1072 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MechShell</strong> is a fast-paced action game that <strong>shifts seamlessly between side-scrolling combat and first-person action</strong>, forcing you to adapt as the battlefield transforms.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the <strong>Gnome Empire</strong>, led by a reclusive Emperor with an oversized ego.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop their quest for total domination using <strong>technology stolen from Shellion</strong>, the ancient snail nation, targeting the thriving capital, <strong>Shellion Prime</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931770/extras/1009