1770/1adbb3d3e23cd56f8bd426b61ab9c8a207fc71ab/ss_1adbb3d3e23cd56f8bd426b61ab9c8a207fc71ab.600x338.jpg?t=1774580959"}],"short_description":"Pilot S.H.E.L.L., a weaponized snail mechsuit, and defend the Overgrown Realms. Customize your shell, unlock abilities, and squad up in 4-player co-op side-scrolling combat. Activate Battlefield Clarity to shift into first-person warfare.","steam_appid":3931770,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://bevmaxgames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}